#20000
The Dominion's Great and Mighty Map Room~
   You stand in the middle of a spherical room.  As you turn you realize
that the room forms a globe and you are standing inside of it, as if you
were trapped in the middle of the earth.  The lands are all around you
and you can see everything....too bad ASCII art sucks so bad, or I'd
draw it for ya...
~
200 0 0
S
#20001
Under Warrior's Way~
   The Widmans River churns eastward here, rushing beneath the western
archway in Elrhinn's town wall.  Above you a bridge called "Warrior's
Way" joins the town to the training yard, and a few warriors lean over
its railing to heckle you as you pass underneath, but the river is your
main concern as the water crashes through the arch.  With quite a bit of
effort you could move upstream to the west.
~
