#20002
Southern Dock of Elrhinn~
   You are at the southernmost section of the docks.  To the north the
docks continue, joining the town between its great, towering walls, and
boats of every size bob at their moorings.  To the east and west the
Widmans River stretches out its blue waters, beckoning you toward new
journeys.
~
