#20003
On the Widmans River~
   The water rushes quickly past, splashing up into your boat as the
current pushes east through the town.  To the west you can see the busy
docks of Elrhinn, and to the north you have a good view of the southern
marketplace, where people wander among the stalls hunting for bargains
on everything they will need to make it through another winter.
~
