#20004
On the Widmans River~
   The river passes beneath the southern bridge leading out of the town.
To the south lies Darkweir Hallow, its dark trees covering the land as
far as you can see, and the branches of the nearest seem to lurch toward
you.  You decide that whoever thought to build the town walls was one
smart individual.  The water flows on to the east.
~
