#20007
On the Widmans River~
   As the river leaves the town it shows its might, pushing its banks
far apart into a very wide bed.  The southern bank rises high above the
water, and beyond it lush green grasslands stretch away south to hills
on the horizon.  To the north beautiful trees bask in the sun, and
beyond them a cluster of enormous peaks rises through the clouds.
~
