#20009
Bend in the Widmans River~
   The river makes a sharp turn here, and you cannot help admiring the
force of the water as it slams into the bank.  Dirt and rocks slide down
into the water and are quickly whisked away downstream.  Luckily the
river is very wide here, and you have no trouble making the turn.  The
water begins to move faster northward as the banks narrow, and looking
west, the town is barely visible on the horizon.
~
