#20010
On the Widmans River~
   The river changes direction, turning east once more and running as
far as the eye can see.  To the south you have a fine view of the hills
beyond the plains, and on the northern bank mountains tower into the
sky, with trees growing up to their base but few climbing their sides.
A little way east the bank slopes down to a place where you could leave
the river.
~
