On the Widmans River~
   The dark water swirls beneath your boat, churning eastward.  The
banks to the north and south are high, hiding whatever may be lurking
above them, and the mountains towering to the north add to a growing
feeling of insecurity.  The river flows east, and you could make your
way back west.
~
