#20013
On the Widmans River~
   Rocks from the mountains to the north litter the river ahead, and the
water begins to speed up and twist into strange pools as it crashes
against them.  Only by paddling with all your strength could you move
upstream to the west.  More rapids lie in the riverbed to the east.
~
