#20014
In the Rapids~
   Water tears at your boat from every side, tossing you about as if you
weighed nothing at all, and each rock juts out of a white crest as if
trying to cut you in half.  Traveling upstream to the west might take
every bit of strength you have.  Downstream the rapids continue.
~
