#20016
In the Rapids~
   The rocks wreak havoc on the bottom and sides of your boat, and it is
all you can do to keep from crashing headfirst into one of the boulders
that line the stream like an oncoming army.  To the east the rapids seem
to slow and the river widens.  Looking west, you can see the Rock of
Pheenix jutting high out of the water.
~
