#20017
On the Widmans River~
   The fury of the rapids is behind you now, and the river moves
peacefully eastward.  The mountains to the north slowly give way to
hills as the land follows the river, and the southern bank has slowly
fallen away as well.  On the horizon you can see the river widening
still further.  Looking west, you can see the rapids in the distance.
~
