#20018
On the Widmans River~
   The water continues on its course east, and looking downstream you
can see that the end of the river is near.  You could move upstream to
the west without much difficulty.  The riverbanks to the north and south
are almost level with the water now; hills have completely replaced the
mountains to the north, and grassy plains run south as far as you can
see.
~
