#20019
On the Widmans River~
   The water moves slowly here as the river carves a wide channel
through the land.  To the east you can see the end of the Widmans River,
where it pours into the Sea of Tears.  A feeling of calm comes over you
as the wind blows east along the riverbed and the gentle sounds of the
water soothe your thoughts.  But the moment passes as you see the still
water of the ocean ahead.
~
