#20020
The Widmans River Delta~
   The riverbanks to the north and south slope down and are swallowed by
high waves rolling in from the Sea of Tears to the east.  The dark ocean
pulls violently at your boat, trying to drag you east.  To the west the
Widmans River flows toward you, carrying water from far-off places; from
as far as the jungles and the Western Mountains it has made its way
east, only to be swallowed by the Sea of Tears.
~
