#20021
Sea of Tears~
   Far off on the western horizon, the Widmans River pours into the sea.
The dark blue waters pull you out into emptiness, and in places the
water is as black as night, a sign that the ocean floor must lie miles
below you.  Besides a mountain range to the northwest, the rolling Sea
of Tears is all you can see.
~
