#20022
Sea of Tears~
   Waves lift your boat and carry it off in whatever direction they
choose.  The Sea of Tears surrounds you, stretching all the way to every
horizon, gray-green and endless.  The constant slap of the crests
against your hull begins to grate on your ears, and you know it will be
some time before you reach dry land... if you can ever find it again.
~
