Sea of Tears~
   You are sailing the vast Sea of Tears, and all about you the water
sparkles and gleams in the golden sun.  Suddenly you notice a pier to
the east!  A golden beach stretches along the eastern horizon, filling
your heart with wanderlust instead of the despair you felt out on the
open sea.
