#20044
Tunnel Strewn with Rubble~
   You have entered a tunnel strewn with rock debris, a sign of recent
mining.  The tunnel is only five feet across, and the walls press in on
you from every side.  The stagnant air smells of sweat, and the ring of
picks against rock echoes throughout the tunnel.  It continues south,
and the entryway lies north.
~
